will see that their IDs are 0, 1, and 2, respectively)\n- Step 2. Delete ID: 1 source and ID: 2 source\n- Step 3. Then add a new source to tileset, u will see that it's ID is 3(the ID calculation includes deleted source IDs)\n- Step 4. If you restart the editor after step 2 and then add a new source, the ID calculation will be correct(new id will be 1)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107018/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}